/**
 * The app's icons, as inline SVG.
 *
 * Bootstrap Icons ships a 2078-class stylesheet plus a ~134 KB webfont; this app
 * draws 30 glyphs from it. Inlining those 30 removes the stylesheet, the font
 * download and the network request that a school LAN without internet cannot
 * make — and an icon can no longer render as an invisible box because a font
 * failed to load.
 *
 * Paths are copied verbatim from node_modules/bootstrap-icons/icons/<name>.svg,
 * which is where a new one should come from too. IkonTest fails the suite if a
 * view asks for a name that is missing here.
 */
